ASTROGRON Public Competition Release Licensing Summary
======================================================

This repository contains multiple software and data components from the
ASTROGRON NASA Space Apps Challenge 2026 competition release
(`astrogron-competition-2026.11.15+95a19217e4ce`). No single blanket open-source
grant overrides third-party dependencies or excluded proprietary assets.

