2. Adaptive Evidence Sidecar Source (`adaptive/`)
-------------------------------------------------
Original ASTROGRON sidecar source (`adaptive/adaptive_evidence/`,
`adaptive/contracts/`, `adaptive/tests/`) is licensed under the Apache License,
Version 2.0 (Apache-2.0). The sidecar remains DISABLED BY DEFAULT in the
competition build pending upstream dependency compatibility verification.
Third-party runtime libraries (`shapely` BSD-3-Clause / GEOS LGPL-2.1-or-later,
`pyproj` / PROJ MIT, `pyshp` MIT, `numpy` BSD-3-Clause, `certifi` MPL-2.0,
`jsonschema` MIT) are NOT vendored in Git and retain their upstream licenses.

3. Core Scientific & Integration Source (`core/`, `handoff/`, scripts)
----------------------------------------------------------------------
Copyright (c) 2026 ASTROGRON Team - NASA Space Apps Challenge.
Original project integration, API, report, chat, and handoff orchestration
code is published here for NASA Space Apps 2026 evaluation by authorization of
the repository owner (`NasaProject2026`). External Python dependencies
(including `pcse==6.0.13`) and restricted/third-party datasets are excluded
from this repository; see `EXCLUDED_ASSETS_AND_RIGHTS.md` and
`NASA_AND_DATA_ATTRIBUTIONS.md`.

4. Public Static Web Assets & Data Notices (`frontend/public/`, `frontend/src/fixtures/`)
-----------------------------------------------------------------------------------------
- Natural Earth 1:110m (`frontend/public/geodata/*`, `frontend/src/fixtures/natural-earth-world.ts`):
  Public Domain (`CC0-1.0`).
- MapLibre GL JS Web Worker (`frontend/public/workers/maplibre-gl-worker.js`):
  `BSD-3-Clause`.
- NASA 3D Resources Landsat 8 (`frontend/public/orbit-ab-assets/landsat_8.glb`) & NASA Blue/Black Marble
  earth textures (`frontend/public/orbit-ab-assets/earth_*.jpg`):
  NASA U.S. Government Public Domain (no NASA endorsement implied) / Three.js `MIT`.
- Google Draco glTF decoder (`frontend/public/orbit-ab-assets/draco/*`):
  `Apache-2.0` (Draco) / `MIT` (Three.js).
- Proprietary commissioned editorial hero artwork (`frontend/public/assets/*.jpg`):
  EXCLUDED from this public repository (creator redistribution clearance not asserted).
